            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To i dwe mar'abirio i oro no won, Isimayil wod pa Nathania aka nyakwar Elisama, ma wok peco pa kere okidho i Mizipa gi cwo apar, omonjo Gedalia to neko go. Go bende oneko Joisiraili kodi Jobabilon m'oyido jonitie kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43:5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Joisiraili je ma joŋaŋ kodi ma jocandi kanyacel gi jotel pa jolweny joringo i Misir kwoŋbedo oyido jolworo Jobabilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Igonyo Yehoyakin wok i katwec",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma Evilmerodak obedo kere ma Babilon, onyutho kere Yehoyakin ma Yuda wor to gonyo go wok i katwec. Gime ka piero ario g'abirio i dwe mar'apar g'ario i oro ma piero adek g'abirio wok cuka tweyi Yehoyakin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evilmerodak otero gine wor, aka omiyo go kabedo ma wor loyo kerin man je m'oyido jonitie i twec i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno oyey Yehoyakin wiro nangin pere ma katwec kodi bedo kanyo cemo kanyacel gi kere i meza pa kere i kwo pere je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi ndelo i kwo pere omiy go pesa ma noknok ri gima go mito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
